{
  "note": "Event schema of the officer daemon at PR 458 head 9c181672 (daemon blob 455e374971198ec54b4561d83d2331c6c60f2da3), one JSON object per line, each with t (ISO time) and ev (name). Read from that source; the live blob a322d588 emits none of heartbeat, exit, state-unreadable, earlier-reply-stuck, state-write-error or send-ambiguous. 'forward' lists the only fields that may leave the host; everything else is private (applicant addresses, reply text, transaction hashes, desk, officer, RPC endpoint) and is dropped by the collector.",
